@startuml
!theme plain
title 顺序图：办理还书（UC-010，含 UC-015 计算超期罚款）
skinparam linetype ortho
autonumber

actor "图书管理员" as Librarian

participant "CirculationController" as Ctrl
participant "CirculationService" as Svc
participant "LibraryItemRepository" as ItemRepo
participant "LoanRepository" as LoanRepo
participant "FineCalculator" as Calc
participant "FineRuleRepository" as RuleRepo
participant "FineRule" as Rule
participant "FineRepository" as FineRepo
participant "LibraryItem" as Item
participant "Loan" as Loan
participant "FineRecord" as Fine

== 1. 请求与权限校验 ==

Librarian -> Ctrl : POST /api/circulation/return\n{barcode}\nHeader: Bearer token
Ctrl -> Svc : return_book(barcode, operator)

alt 操作者不是 Librarian
    Svc --> Ctrl : raise PermissionDeniedError
    Ctrl --> Librarian : 403 仅图书管理员可办理还书
else 角色校验通过
    Svc -> Svc : 记录事务开始
end

== 2. 校验馆藏（BR-010） ==

Svc -> ItemRepo : find_by_barcode(barcode)
ItemRepo --> Svc : LibraryItem

alt 馆藏不存在或非本馆藏书
    Svc --> Ctrl : raise BusinessError
    Ctrl --> Librarian : 400 非本馆藏书
end

== 3. 查找未归还借阅记录 ==

Svc -> LoanRepo : find_active_by_item(item_id)
LoanRepo --> Svc : Loan | None

alt 未找到未归还记录
    Svc --> Ctrl : raise BusinessError
    Ctrl --> Librarian : 400 未找到该馆藏的借阅记录
end

== 4. 执行归还 ==

Svc -> Loan : return_item(today)
activate Loan
Loan -> Loan : return_date = today\nstatus = RETURNED
Loan --> Svc : overdue_days = (today - due_date).days
deactivate Loan

Svc -> Item : mark_available()
activate Item
Item --> Svc : status = AVAILABLE
deactivate Item

== 5. 超期罚款计算（UC-015，含宽限期 BR-005） ==

alt overdue_days <= 0
    Svc --> Svc : 未超期，罚款 0，不生成记录
else overdue_days > 0
    Svc -> Calc : calculate(loan, today)
    Calc -> RuleRepo : get(item.fine_category)
    RuleRepo --> Calc : FineRule{grace_days, amount_per_day}

    alt 未配置罚款规则
        Calc --> Svc : raise InfrastructureError
        Svc --> Ctrl : 500 未配置罚款规则
    else 规则存在
        Calc -> Rule : get_grace_days()
        Rule --> Calc : grace_days
        alt overdue_days <= grace_days
            Calc --> Svc : 0.00（宽限期内，判定超期但不计费）
        else 超出宽限期
            Calc -> Rule : calculate_fine(days, amount)
            Rule --> Calc : chargeable = overdue_days - grace_days\namount = chargeable × amount_per_day
            Calc -> Fine : create(loan_id, amount, paid=false)
            activate Fine
            Fine --> Calc : FineRecord
            deactivate Fine
            Calc -> FineRepo : add(fine_record)
            FineRepo --> Calc : fine_id
            Calc --> Svc : amount
        end
    end
end

== 6. 提交与返回 ==

alt 提交成功
    Svc -> Svc : commit 事务\n（Loan + Item + FineRecord 原子提交）
    Svc --> Ctrl : ReturnResultDTO{loan_id, return_date,\noverdue_days, fine}
    Ctrl --> Librarian : 200 归还成功（超期 n 天，罚款 x 元）
else 提交失败
    Svc -> Svc : rollback 事务
    Svc --> Ctrl : raise InfrastructureError
    Ctrl --> Librarian : 500 系统繁忙，请稍后重试
end

@enduml
